Description: native Linux launcher for DayZ
 DZLL is a native Linux launcher for DayZ with Steam Client Workshop mod
 handling and SteamCMD as an advanced fallback. Native Steam is required;
 Flatpak Steam is unsupported. Discord Rich Presence is supported through
 the bundled pypresence fallback.
 .
 This is a project-distributed source-available package and is not intended
 for acceptance into Debian or Ubuntu official free-software archives.
